'''Guppy''' is a [[transformation]], turning Isaac into his cat Guppy after picking up 3 Guppy-related items.

== Effects ==
* Grants [[flight]].
* {{dlc|nr}} Spawns a [[Blue Fly]] each time a tear from Isaac or one of its familiars hits an enemy.
* {{dlc|r}} Grants a 66% chance to spawn a [[Blue Fly]] each time a tear from Isaac or one of its familiars hits an enemy.

== Requirements ==
Pick up 3 [[item]]s or [[trinket]]s from the following list ({{dlc|r}} with the [[Item Tags guppy|{{code|guppy}} tag]]).

=== Activated Collectibles ===
{{collectible table | Guppy's Head, Guppy's Paw }}

=== Passive Collectibles ===
{{collectible table | Dead Cat, Guppy's Collar, Guppy's Tail, Guppy's Hairball, Guppy's Eye }}

=== Trinkets ===
{{trinket table | Kid's Drawing }}

== Notes ==
* {{i|Technology 2}} spawns flies only very rarely.
* {{dlc|na+r}} If Isaac has transformed into Guppy, Guppy's Hairball spawns Blue Flies when it deals damage.
* {{dlc|r}} If all the 9 extra lives have been consumed, {{I|Dead Cat}} is removed from Isaac's inventory. This causes the transformation to be removed.
* {{dlc|r}} Blue flies will only spawn if Isaac has less than 30 blue flies.

== Unlockable [[Achievement]]s ==
{{achievement text | Guppy's Hairball, Cat Got Your Tongue }}

== Trivia ==
* This transformation is a reference to Edmund's first cat, as seen in some of his early videos on his personal channel.<ref>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=trUCcvtN1lA</ref>
** Guppy the cat passed away in 2014.<ref>https://twitter.com/edmundmcmillen/status/501914984285077504</ref>
* {{dlc|a+}} Transforming into Guppy as {{c|The Forgotten}} will give him the appearance of a cat's skeleton.
* {{dlc|r}} The [[Item Tags guppy|<code>guppy</code> item tag]] determines if an item counts towards the transformation, except for {{t|Kid's Drawing|n}} which seems to be hard-coded to count as a Guppy item despite not having the tag.

